/// Retained capabilities for every pre-existing Git directory that a Ways
/// plumbing batch may write through. Axocoatl stops all of its Workspace
/// writers before creating this guard; keeping the descriptors alive and
/// revalidating the same inodes around the batch makes a pre-created or swapped
/// symlink/hardlink topology fail closed.
